// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`toMarkdown > builds the report for a fixed input 1`] = `
"# Accessibility report

Page: https://example.com/page
Date: 2026-10-27

## Design

- [ ] Serious: Text is hard to read against its background. How to fix: Make the text darker or the background lighter until the text is easy to read. Check the color pair with any contrast checker.

## Content

- [ ] Critical: Image has no text description. How to fix: Add a short description that conveys what the image means. If the image is purely decorative, mark it as decorative.
- [ ] Serious: Link has no meaningful text. How to fix: Write link text that says where the link leads. Avoid bare “click here” or “read more”.

## Code

- [ ] Critical: Form field has no label. How to fix: Attach a visible label to the field instead of relying on placeholder text alone. The label should stay in place while someone types.
- [ ] Minor: Tab order has been changed. How to fix: Ask developers to remove the extra tab-order settings and keep the natural order of elements. Focus then moves top to bottom, the way the page reads.
- [ ] Minor: Some new rule must pass.
"
`;
